{"id": "inspection-73cfaeca19f10303b6a6", "title": "SCA Pharmaceuticals LLC — FDA Form 483 및 API 관찰사항 (실사 종료 2024-12-20)", "country": "미국", "facility_country": "", "agency": "FDA", "published_date": "2024-12-20", "source_title": "SCA Pharmaceuticals LLC", "source_type": "FDA Form 483", "company": "SCA Pharmaceuticals LLC", "cfr": "21 CFR 211.42(c)(10)(iv), 21 CFR 211.188, 21 CFR 211.100(a), 21 CFR 211.67(b), 21 CFR 211.63, 21 CFR 211.113(b), 21 CFR 211.192", "ai_summary": "FDA Form 483 원문 기준, SCA Pharmaceuticals LLC는 멸균 주사제 제조에서 1,200건 이상의 공급업체 이물 보고와 환경·작업자 모니터링 누락 사례를 충분히 평가하지 않고 사용·출하했다. 또한 제조공정의 역가 변동으로 다수 로트가 거부되었고, LAFH 청소·소독 및 환경모니터링 절차가 불충분해 QA의 일탈·CAPA·출하평가와 생산의 무균공정 관리에 중대한 영향을 준다.", "source_summary": "SCA Pharmaceuticals LLC — 483 (2024-12-20)", "summary_provider": "codex", "summary_model": "gpt-5.6-luna", "summary_status": "success", "summary_coverage": "extracted_body", "summary_quality": "automated_checks_only", "summary_review": {"method": "Codex GPT 요약 + 원문 근거 문구 자동 일치 검사", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-01", "scope": "FDA OII FOIA Electronic Reading Room에 공개된 Form 483 PDF의 추출 본문을 검토했습니다. 자동 텍스트 추출이며 사람의 시각 검수를 뜻하지 않습니다.", "visual_review": false}, "change_summary": "FDA Form 483 원문 기준, SCA Pharmaceuticals LLC는 멸균 주사제 제조에서 1,200건 이상의 공급업체 이물 보고와 환경·작업자 모니터링 누락 사례를 충분히 평가하지 않고 사용·출하했다. 또한 제조공정의 역가 변동으로 다수 로트가 거부되었고, LAFH 청소·소독 및 환경모니터링 절차가 불충분해 QA의 일탈·CAPA·출하평가와 생산의 무균공정 관리에 중대한 영향을 준다.", "impact_summary": "", "background": "", "purpose": "", "changes_before": "", "changes_after": "", "affected_work": "", "recommendation": "", "key_quote": "", "importance": "높음", "tags": "QA, 생산, QC, RA", "created_at": "2024-12-20", "link": "https://www.fda.gov/media/185240/download", "practical_review": {"impact_summary": {"status": "found", "value": "FDA는 이 483이 최종 위반 판정은 아니라고 명시하면서, 멸균 주사제의 이물·역가 편차·환경 모니터링 누락 및 공정 관리 문제를 관찰사항으로 제시했습니다.", "evidence": [{"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "755 Rainbow Rd Ste B CITY. STATE. ZIP CODE. COUNTRY Windsor, CT 06095 - 1024 TYPE ESTABLISHMENT INSPECTED Outsourcing Facility This document lists observations made by the FDA representative(s) dtu-ing the inspection ofyotu· facility. They are inspectional observations , and do not represent a final Agency determination regarding yotu· compliance. Ifyou have an objection regarding an observation , or have in1plemented, or plan to implement , corrective action in response to an observation , you may discuss the objection or action with the FDA representative{s) dtu-ing the inspection or submit"}]}, "affected_work": {"status": "found", "value": "영향 대상은 SCA의 멸균 주사제 제조와 관련 공정입니다. 주사기 트레이 이물, 누락된 환경·인원 모니터링, 역가 OOS, 청정구역 세척·장비 관리, 배치 수율 기록 등이 지적됐습니다.", "evidence": [{"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "gth, purity, and quality that they are pmported or represented to possess. Specifically, Your fnm failed to adequately validate the manufacturing process for your sterile injectable products across multiple product lines, e.g., Vancomycin, Potassium Chloride, Norepinephrine, Potassium Phosphate, Phenylephrine, Diltiazem, and Oxytocin. From October 2023 until December 2024, your fnm initiated approximately 24 manufacturing investigations classified as \"Confnm ed for potency OOS\" representing 34 lots of sterile drng products. Your fnm fails to address the root causes of ''variable potency result"}, {"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "te risk assessments for diug products that were released in cases where Environmental Monitoring or Personnel Monitoring samples were not collected during production. For example: Deviation Number Drng Product Lot number EM Iniss ing DEV-2024-0490 Hydi·omorphone HCl 1 mg/mL in o.9% Sodium Chloride 30 mL fill Syringe (30 mg/3o mL) (b (4) I Compound date: 10/10/2024, Expiration 01/23/2025 Aseptic Compounder finge1i ip samples DEV-2023-0572 Diltiazem HCl 125 mg lin 0.9% Sodium ~ hloride 125 mL Bag (6) (4) I Compound date: 10/30/2024, Expiration: 02/27/2025 Aseptic Compounder finge1i ip samples DE"}, {"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "the difficult to clean areas. These areas of concern can harbor microorganisms that could contaminate diug product pmpo1ied to be sterile. OBS ERVATION 5 Batch productio n and control records do not include complete info1mation relating to the production and control of each batch. Specifica lly, your fnm failed to adequately calculate the theoretical and actual batch yield steps at each phase of the production process for all sterile di11g process. Your fnm 's calculated actual batch yield steps are not inclusive of all products produced during the manufacturing n m. For example, during the p"}]}, "recommendation": {"status": "found", "value": "FDA는 관찰사항에 이의가 있거나 시정조치를 시행했거나 계획 중이면 실사 중 FDA 담당자와 논의하거나 해당 FDA 사무소로 관련 정보를 제출할 수 있다고 안내합니다.", "evidence": [{"field": "상세.본문발췌", "quote": "or have in1plemented, or plan to implement , corrective action in response to an observation , you may discuss the objection or action with the FDA representative{s) dtu-ing the inspection or submit this infom1ation to FDA at the address above. If you have any questions, please contact FDA at the phone ntunber and address above . DURING AN INSPECTION OF YOUR FIRM WE OBSERVED: OBSERVATION 1 There is a failure to thoroughly review any unexplained discrepancy whether or not the batch has been ah eady distributed. Specifically, A. Your fnm failed to adequately assess and implement an effective co"}]}, "effective_date": {"status": "not_stated", "value": "", "evidence": []}, "response_deadline": {"status": "not_stated", "value": "", "evidence": []}, "reviewed_at": "2026-10-22", "model": "gpt-6-luna", "source_url": "https://www.fda.gov/media/185240/download", "scope": "확보한 본문 기준 · 첨부 및 미확보 페이지는 제외 · 자동 추출"}, "content_scope": "case", "scope_reason": "실무 관련성 검토 필요", "topics": ["sterility", "validation", "deviation-capa", "laboratory"], "classification_method": "source-keywords-v1", "classification_status": "rule_matched", "inspection_end_date": "2024-12-20", "official_published_at": "2025-01-21", "first_seen_at": "